><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
